om/users/DenissLarka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-apple-diskimage","state":"uploaded","size":101784263,"digest":"sha256:ff94af5cf0c7f2bfba315a564838f73a69f004a657acfe89dd41069d0dffc535","download_count":6,"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:37:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T21:37:08Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/DenissLarka/letterblade/releases/download/v1.1.1/Letterblade.dmg"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DenissLarka/letterblade/releases/assets/679488608","id":679488608,"node_id":"RA_kwDOTdMFHM4ogCxg","name":"Letterblade.msix","label":"","uploader":{"login":"DenissLarka","id":1607465,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MDc0NjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1607465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka","html_url":"https://github.com/DenissLarka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenissLarka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":95325475,"digest":"sha256:0f063ec8be63f27e870fcf50a3db760d29d2bdcc554417fbaf3c97cab5398c7c","download_count":6,"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:11:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T21:11:38Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/DenissLarka/letterblade/releases/download/v1.1.1/Letterblade.msix"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DenissLarka/letterblade/tarball/v1.1.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DenissLarka/letterblade/zipball/v1.1.1","body":"**Open .msg files straight from your desktop.**\n\n## What's new\n\n- **Open a `.msg` file from your file manager.** On macOS, double-click it in Finder, or choose Open With → Letterblade (where Outlook is installed, Outlook keeps the double-click). On Windows, right-click it and choose Open with → Letterblade (where Outlook is installed, Outlook keeps the double-click). On Linux, once a desktop tool such as AppImageLauncher has added Letterblade to your applications.\n- **Help → About** shows the version you are running. On macOS the About entry had disappeared from the application menu; it now sits in Help on every system.\n- **The Letterblade icon on every window**: in the title bar, the window switcher and the taskbar, sharp at the small sizes too.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- **Windows: the title bar has the right size on every screen** when two screens use different scaling.\n- **Windows: files named in another alphabet open**, a Cyrillic name on an English Windows for example. The app used to receive the name garbled and could not find the file.\n- **Windows: an update no longer closes Letterblade.** It installs while the app runs, and the new version starts the next time you open it. The update from 1.1.0 still closes the app once, because 1.1.0's own updater runs it.\n- **Linux: Letterblade's windows group under its entry** in the dock, once a desktop tool has added it to your applications.\n\n## Download\n\n- **macOS (Apple Silicon):** `Letterblade.dmg`, signed with an Apple Developer ID and notarized by Apple.\n- **Windows 10 / 11 (x64):** `Letterblade.msix`, code-signed.\n- **Linux (x86_64):** `Letterblade.AppImage`.\n\nThe Java runtime is bundled; there is nothing else to install. An installed 1.0.0 or 1.1.0 offers this update by itself.\n\n## Verify the download\n\n```\n# macOS\nshasum -a 256 Letterblade.dmg\n# ff94af5cf0c7f2bfba315a564838f73a69f004a657acfe89dd41069d0dffc535\n```\n\n```\n# Windows (PowerShell)\nGet-FileHash Letterblade.msix -Algorithm SHA256\n# 0f063ec8be63f27e870fcf50a3db760d29d2bdcc554417fbaf3c97cab5398c7c\n```\n\n```\n# Linux\nsha256sum Letterblade.AppImage\n# 8308ea530045c00f00b49fb8f3360ceb8f00d641c0c4becb2ada0214928488dc\n```\n"}